<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND V PAKISTAN BOARD XI TIE DRAWN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND V PAKISTAN BOARD XI TIE DRAWN.</headline>
<dateline>SAHIWAL, Pakistan 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The three-day match</p>
<p>between New Zealand and a Pakistan Cricket Board (PCB) XI ended</p>
<p>in a draw on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: New Zealand 171 and 211 for seven declared, PCB XI</p>
<p>193 for seven declared and 41 without loss.</p>
</text>
